ation still had overlay; then BACK went up one level. Let me just press BACK once and see.\n\nActually, pressing BACK once while search overlay open earlier led to AndroidQA (up one folder). That suggests BACK closed search + navigated up, or that the back arrow tap had already closed the search but stale observation. Hmm confusing. Let me instead tap the X to clear then tap the back arrow, then observe.\n\nFirst tap X (element 35) to clear query."}
